  "results": [
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u003",
      "targetTextSha256": "c591952d33445f46970085d8eb4df4d9ff9fbb62e8ae5fedefde9fe52255fb95",
      "audioSha256": "51e384ad71335024a19c66c6224257c3c28f365e049f25c87c6e94859f407f9b",
      "recognized": "那股强烈的劲头是他的核心特质，所以他做任何事都带着这股强烈的劲头。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u004",
      "targetTextSha256": "104bb5b9e7ab3d4fca775709c9606694f0a0dcf399ef049369d408e153e930b6",
      "audioSha256": "652c3a88480fd18487ea1b3a41f7cd6b61417f3eaa4c74c30b17b1299e0446a6",
      "recognized": "所以，同样地，神出于他圣洁这一核心属性，无论做什么，在道德上都是完全的。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u005",
      "targetTextSha256": "59d025be80c2a12f2c90ddc7589eb0d66f3eabb10ab5b9505f18688f889a388c",
      "audioSha256": "a4b277954d28a82956e58d18b5b9f3cbfbb64b3c5d43338f7e3cc44b5da6d710",
      "recognized": "这就意味着，如果神带来这些神圣的警告，他会以怎样的方式来做呢？",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u006",
      "targetTextSha256": "c678b86e8037ecb406eccc765bb46312da5795a52bbbda288bc99d83a7055f1a",
      "audioSha256": "4457f0a44840e01384c82712488515c43de32bdea45fe6d5f3faa49c5c7f7329",
      "recognized": "以道德上完美无瑕的方式来做。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u007",
      "targetTextSha256": "0394b175b9d9f8a7ae920487d925009b05d2b2a1ad1fbed9d1d82da1b84e7323",
      "audioSha256": "fb3753db0ffd04fb3256cc780e3af734a79759f016dce3ecd3193b8ab2ab9b0f",
      "recognized": "所以，当我们来看第八章时，有一件事特别令人惊叹：在神的警告，也就是浩筒的警告还没有发出之前。",
      "similarity": 0.97561,
      "differences": [
        {
          "kind": "replace",
          "expected": [
            "号"
          ],
          "recognized": [
            "浩"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u008",
      "targetTextSha256": "e037307b25d63ff0f14ba857a05b839f9e52cc1626394e18cc3d3b13b6cd3c3d",
      "audioSha256": "b856fe7708e81cf0ef87280c026c0b4c5de7d7cd3cfcc0ffab143c883c0c23d7",
      "recognized": "作为作者，使徒约翰首先清楚地表明了神的圣洁。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u009",
      "targetTextSha256": "4a62e392a914e30576e3bf2d8cb2180bdf30bc20dc759b475b95540697fb9775",
      "audioSha256": "9f75789f35104a5c67502e7131944998396c13a57450ecbc0e250db04bd0c1f9",
      "recognized": "这在两个方面都令人惊叹。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u010",
      "targetTextSha256": "c84488d717a5ff165e0034fd22e5319829e24ef2c17d8d2dc6bfb26160c6e311",
      "audioSha256": "80964227d5ae0b10b1c41fca08b7a44b78c2fe652d1624301563d99802738e53",
      "recognized": "第一是通过静默。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u011",
      "targetTextSha256": "a80ee073782390ff342e4fbc4d27a25ae95cdb836f38ed3eefd70682bdf43d84",
      "audioSha256": "c965e3085a09aaaa9022e6aac9396f5f4cc5a3b8ed09d3c4c2c9d05005909120",
      "recognized": "静默。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u012",
      "targetTextSha256": "a4bbdbbda60515062da0f942af797d9d7fbbfdc30a968f51a0bfa1170dfe79e1",
      "audioSha256": "1dfeefe42660448319945dfc8d6a816347a58fda0c8ae3dffae0595b585ee8b8",
      "recognized": "你们知道，在旧约里，静默常常与神的圣洁联系在一起。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u013",
      "targetTextSha256": "76f5f4021f1b247977c6fa11c227dce298913d6ecf586635a864c9cd814af084",
      "audioSha256": "7fa5bcf833d0804696ff0bf6f17c53345012d6939cb546f197661789bea5989b",
      "recognized": "比如，看看《哈巴谷书》第二章。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u014",
      "targetTextSha256": "bb50602640d33bde0cc63eb8cb45d0722fd999217f0781cf5fbe7f6dca957c15",
      "audioSha256": "8921ef5a3916fca56c2c5374fa171931eeb510ae8ba00b3b447ac4bcc1f1740c",
      "recognized": "但是，主在他的圣殿里。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u015",
      "targetTextSha256": "a25b4ee0d067ee8ca7bdd47f9ecfac052391e7cc29ccf944d7f1105ddacc3ccd",
      "audioSha256": "a25e4b674777284cf663d44ac219b38cd6909b342fecb0af88d5e873ba7a9cc4",
      "recognized": "全地都要在他面前保持安静。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u016",
      "targetTextSha256": "524ce2743774f40ad726aac15fe1ce72b6e6861c8dc2f2db496131ea7f7320db",
      "audioSha256": "ee73e4f6c9692f5e0e547c4f99d63424f52896651b8a53421e353bc33dc3b36a",
      "recognized": "请留意第八章的第一节。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
      "textGroupId": "translation-chunk-0005-u017",
      "targetTextSha256": "f3fd4af85397075df219a1eabf2c1d0b5ca3a329c930ea849ab8816e49735d39",
      "audioSha256": "3e9ead285405bcf26890924a638c0ae7e3697651fe58fbcb136c492adc6d8e7f",
      "recognized": "当他揭开第七印时，天上寂静了大约半个小时。",
      "similarity": 1.0,
      "differences": [],
      "status": "pass"
    },
    {
